## **Existing Program/Volunteer Forms (retained in the handbooks)**

Participant Release of Liability, Documentation Style Guide, Program Enrollment, Volunteer Application, Emergency Contact, Photo & Media Release, Accessibility Accommodations, Incident Report, Volunteer Hours Tracking, Participant Feedback — all in `lost_limb_riders_handbooks/04-Forms-and-Templates/`.

## **Usage Rules**

1. Use the current version listed in the Document Register (ADM-DOC-001).
2. Blank forms are templates. Completed forms are records — store per REC-LOC-001.
3. A form without its procedure is incomplete. A procedure without its record is unfulfilled.

